@startuml
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFF0
skinparam noteBorderColor #BA7517

title Fault sequence — server crash

actor "Player" as P
participant "Client\nclient.py" as C
participant "Server\nserver.py" as S

P -> C : press movement key (W/A/S/D)
C -> S : PUSH {player_id, direction, seq=1}
S --> C : PUB game state (seq=1 confirmed)
C -> C : render_state()

note over S #FF9999
  SERVER CRASH
  (process killed or network lost)
end note

C -> S : PUSH {direction, seq=2}
note right of C
  no response from server
end note

C -> C : wait_for_my_move()\nblocks on SUB recv
C -> C : RCVTIMEO 3000 ms expires
C -> C : print "Server not responding\n— possible crash or network lag"
C -> C : return None\nclient halts input loop

note over C, S
  Known prototype limitation:
  No reconnect or crash recovery.
  Server state (scores, positions)
  is lost. All clients must rejoin.
end note
@enduml